      "title_ja": "How the jar became a box（壺が箱になったのは）",
      "text": "So where did Pandora's box come from? The change is usually traced to Erasmus. In his book of proverbs, printed in Venice in 1508, Hesiod's pithos, a great jar, became a pyxis, a small box. The word stuck.",
