      "title_ja": "Why did hope stay?（なぜ希望だけが残ったのか）",
      "text": "When Pandora lifted the lid, countless troubles spread among humankind. Only hope stayed inside, beneath the rim of the jar. The lid stopped it, by the will of Zeus. Was hope kept safe for us, or kept away from us? Hesiod does not say.",
